th per number of mice per group; HTCA, growth in the human tumour colony assay, colony growth of control was set 100&#x00025;; TRF, mean telomere restriction fragment length in kilo bases; CR, complete remission; PR, partial regression at any time during the experiment compared to initial tumour volume; P, progression.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>